WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.980
Sure.

2
00:00:01.980 --> 00:00:17.160
I would like to see the Jesuits do a bit more outreach in descendant communities, especially communities where there are large concentrations of descendants.

3
00:00:17.160 --> 00:00:27.600
Let’s start building those relationships and educational opportunities for those children as well.

4
00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:31.240
What is a reparation?

5
00:00:31.240 --> 00:00:38.060
Is it money in a person’s hand, or is it value in kind?

6
00:00:38.060 --> 00:00:44.780
Nobody could give me enough money for me to come here and [be] paid to do this.

7
00:00:44.780 --> 00:00:53.160
I would like to see this opportunity [to attend university] within the framework of what the Jesuits do.

8
00:00:53.160 --> 00:00:59.140
They provide great education across the country, and the world.

9
00:00:59.140 --> 00:01:18.040
So, within the framework of what they do, in terms of suspended tuition in high schools, in elementary schools, partnering to raise funds with descendant groups.

10
00:01:18.040 --> 00:01:23.980
Can anybody pay me for my family and them being sold?

11
00:01:23.980 --> 00:01:27.120
No. There’s no money for that.

12
00:01:27.120 --> 00:01:34.300
I can’t even factor that into a dollar amount.

13
00:01:34.300 --> 00:01:35.640
For me.
